        ],
        "name": "/Helvetica-Bold",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        169.23128513071896,
        172.38724368686883,
        335.1431446078431,
        19.106155303030164
      ],
      "text": "Host attachment planning",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/Helvetica-Bold",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        229.11764705882356,
        214.2258929924243,
        687.5108950163399,
        11.923403093434445
      ],
      "text": "The typical FC host attachment to the Storwize V7000 is done through SAN fabric. However, ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/Helvetica",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        229.11764705882356,
        229.75595012626263,
        671.5921760620915,
        11.923416035353625
      ],
      "text": "the system allows direct attachment connectivity between its 8 Gb or 16 Gb Fibre Channel ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/Helvetica",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        229.11764705882356,
        245.28602020202027,
        686.5488688725491,
        11.923403093434217
      ],
      "text": "ports and host ports. No special configuration is required for host systems that are using this ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/Helvetica",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        229.11764705882356,
        260.8160902777778,
        687.5160032679739,
        11.923403093434331
      ],
      "text": "configuration. However, the maximum number of directly attached hosts is severely limited by ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/Helvetica",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        229.11764705882356,
        276.34614741161624,
        399.90755187908496,
        11.923416035353398
      ],
      "text": "the number of FC ports on Storwize V7000\u2019s nodes.",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/Helvetica",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        229.11764705882356,
        304.76631723484854,
        687.4410710784314,
        11.923403093434331
      ],
      "text": "The Storwize V7000 imposes no particular limit on the distance between the Storwize V7000 ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/Helvetica",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        229.11764705882356,
        320.2963873106062,
        672.0405298202614,
        11.923403093434217
      ],
      "text": "nodes and host servers. However, for host attachment, the Storwize V7000 supports up to ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/Helvetica",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        229.11764705882356,
        335.8264573863637,
        678.4197144607843,
        11.923403093434331
      ],
      "text": "three ISL hops in the fabric. This capacity means that the server to the Storwize V7000 can ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/Helvetica",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        229.11764705882356,
        351.35651452020204,
        684.1278925653595,
        11.923416035353512
      ],
      "text": "be separated by up to five FC links, four of which can be 10 km long (6.2 miles) if long wave ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/Helvetica",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        229.11764705882356,
        366.8866234217172,
        356.3008194444445,
        11.923364267676789
      ],
      "text": "Small Form-factor Pluggables (SFPs) are used. ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/Helvetica",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        229.11764705882356,
        395.3841600378788,
        687.5460665849672,
        11.923364267676789
      ],
      "text": "Figure 3-9 shows an example of a supported configuration with Storwize V7000 nodes using ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/Helvetica",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
